+          <p><strong>About Fast figure</strong></p>
+          <p>
+            Fast figure is a single-file workspace for quickly assembling scientific figure drafts
+            from tabular data and images.
+          </p>
+          <p>
+            It combines graph creation, image placement, slot-based figure layout, labels, captions,
+            project packaging, and image and Plotly export.
+          </p>
+          <p>
+            Fast figure runs as a self-contained HTML file and processes loaded data and images
+            locally in the browser. Ordinary use does not require a server, account, or network
+            connection.
+          </p>
+          <p><strong>Application version</strong></p>
+          <p><code>{{APP_BUILD}}</code></p>
+          <p><strong>Developer</strong></p>
+          <ul>
+            <li>Name: 노대권 (Daegwon Noh)</li>
+          </ul>
+          <p><strong>Distribution</strong></p>
+          <p>
+            Repository:
